    "title": "Where to watch WrestleMania 2026. WrestleMania 42 start time",
    "text": "Where to watch WrestleMania 2026. WrestleMania 42 start timeIt might be April, but we're not fooling, WrestleMania season is right around the corner.WWE has been working overtime on action since the Royal Rumble, and in less than three weeks, we'll know where the promotion is headed for the rest of the year.AdvertisementIt's WrestleMania time. Here's everything you need to know about the upcoming show. And while the card listed below is every official match as of April 1, more could be added.When is WrestleMania 42?WrestleMania 42 will be held April 18 and 19.WrestleMania 42 will be held at Allegiant Stadium in Las Vegas.What time will WrestleMania 42 start?WrestleMania 42 is slated to start at 6 p.m. each night.Where to watch WrestleMania 42The first hour of each night of WrestleMania 42 will air on ESPN. The rest of the card will air on ESPN Unlimited.Who is hosting WrestleMania?John Cena will host WrestleMania 42.WrestleMania cardCM Punk vs. Roman Reigns for the World Heavyweight ChampionshipCody Rhodes vs. Randy Orton for the Undisputed ChampionshipStephanie Vaquer vs. Liv Morgan for the WWE Women's World ChampionshipJade Cargill vs. Rhea Ripley for the WWE Women's ChampionshipBrock Lesnar vs. Oba FemiAJ Lee vs. Becky Lynch for the Women's Intercontinental ChampionshipSami Zayn vs. Trick Williams for the United States ChampionshipDrew McIntyre vs. Jacob Fatu, unsanctioned matchSeth Rollins vs. GuntherPenta vs. Je'Von Evans vs. Dragon Lee vs. JD McDonagh vs. Rusev in a ladder match for the WWE championshipFinn Balor vs. Dominik MysterioAdvertisementNight 1 predictionsCody Rhodes vs. Randy Orton for the Undisputed ChampionshipJade Cargill vs. Rhea Ripley for the WWE Women's ChampionshipBrock Lesnar vs. Oba FemiSeth Rollins vs. GuntherPenta vs. Je'Von Evans vs. Dragon Lee vs. JD McDonagh vs. Rusev in a ladder match for the WWE championshipFinn Balor vs. Dominik MysterioNight 2 predictionsCM Punk vs. Roman Reigns for the World Heavyweight ChampionshipStephanie Vaquer vs. Liv Morgan for the WWE Women's World ChampionshipDrew McIntyre vs. Jacob Fatu, unsanctioned matchAJ Lee vs. Becky Lynch for the Women's Intercontinental ChampionshipAdvertisementSami Zayn vs. Trick Williams for the United States ChampionshipWill the Rock be at WrestleMania?It's always possible, but nothing is set in stone, at least for people not behind the scenes. Orton has been talking to someone about his championship match with Cody, but we don't know who that is. Is it the Rock? Is it Vince McMahon? Is it Rob Van Dam? Probably not RVD, but he's my favorite! Hopefully we find out before or at WrestleMania.This article originally appeared on Asbury Park Press: WrestleMania 42 matches night 1, night 2 predictions",
